menu "RoboHub DS18B20 driver"

config RH_DRV_DS18B20
    bool "DS18B20 1-Wire temperature sensor"
    select RH_HAL_ONEWIRE
    select RH_HAL_TIMER
    default n
    help
      The Maxim DS18B20 temperature sensor, reached through a 1-Wire bus and a
      timer the selected platform implements. An application that sets this
      gets the driver compiled in; one that does not pays for none of it.

endmenu
